                    "prompt": "### Instructions for this stage\n- Briefly acknowledge the caller wants a card recommendation. Mention that NeoBank offers both cashback cards and travel/rewards cards, using the language of the caller's most recent message.\n- If the caller has not yet told you BOTH (a) whether they want more cashback or more travel/rewards points, and (b) whether they spend more domestically or overseas, say, in the language of the caller's most recent message, exactly and only: Taglish: \"Mas gusto po ba ninyo ng more cashback, o more travel and rewards points? At mas madalas po ba kayong gumastos locally o overseas?\" | English: \"Are you looking for more cashback, or more travel and rewards points? And do you spend more domestically or overseas?\"\n\n### ResponseHandling\n#### If the caller's response does not clearly answer the question (vague, silent, off-topic, or confusing), and this is the FIRST time this has happened at this stage\n-> Briefly acknowledge you didn't quite catch that, matching the language of the caller's most recent message (Taglish: \"Sorry po, hindi ko po narinig nang malinaw.\" | English: \"Sorry, I didn't quite catch that.\"), then ask the same question again.\n#### If the caller's response again does not clearly answer, and this has already happened once before at this stage\n-> Move to the Human Agent closing.",
