            "prompt": "### Instructions for this stage\n- Say, in the language of the caller's most recent message, exactly and only: Taglish: \"Thank you po for calling NeoBank, ingat po kayo, bye!\" | English: \"Thank you for calling NeoBank, take care, goodbye.\"\n- Do not add any other information to this message. Just say the exact matching-language line.",
