        {
            "functions": [],
            "id": "human-agent-closing",
            "name": "Human Agent - General",
            "nextStages": [
                {
                    "condition": "",
                    "nextStageId": "07e5dff6-01d7-4461-b5d0-9259036c7ab5"
                }
            ],
            "prompt": "### Instructions for this stage\n- Pick the ONE line below that matches the reason you are moving to this stage, and say it exactly in the language of the caller's most recent message. Do not blend lines together, do not add anything else, and do not improvise your own wording.\n- After speaking the matching line, the call proceeds to the transfer.\n\n##### If the caller reported a lost or stolen card\nTaglish: \"Naku, sorry to hear that po. I-connect ko po kayo sa colleague namin para ma-block ang card ninyo at matulungan kayo. Pwede po ba kayong mag-hold sandali?\" | English: \"I'm sorry to hear that. I'll get this connected so someone can block your card and help you. Can you hold on for a moment?\"\n\n##### If the caller reported fraud, a scam, an unauthorised transaction, or a threat to account security\nTaglish: \"Salamat po sa pag-inform sa amin. I-connect ko po kayo agad sa fraud team namin. Pwede po ba kayong mag-hold sandali?\" | English: \"Thank you for letting me know. I'll get this connected to our fraud team right away. Can you hold on for a moment?\"\n\n##### If the caller wants to make a formal complaint\nTaglish: \"Naiintindihan ko po. I-connect ko po kayo sa colleague namin na pwedeng mag-look into ng complaint ninyo. Pwede po ba kayong mag-hold sandali?\" | English: \"I understand. I'll get this connected to someone who can look into your complaint. Can you hold on for a moment?\"\n\n##### If the caller explicitly asked to speak with a human agent or person\nTaglish: \"Sige po, i-connect ko na po kayo sa colleague namin ngayon. Pwede po ba kayong mag-hold sandali?\" | English: \"Of course, connecting you to a colleague now. Can you hold on for a moment?\"\n\n##### If the caller was unable to complete a self-service step-by-step process (e.g. resetting a password) and needs help finishing it\nTaglish: \"Kailangan po itong ma-complete sa app, kaya i-connect ko po kayo sa colleague namin na makakatulong. Pwede po ba kayong mag-hold sandali?\" | English: \"This needs to be finished in the app, so I'll connect you to someone who can help. Can you hold on for a moment?\"\n\n##### For any other reason (e.g. the caller was unclear or silent twice in a row, asked for an account action, or was rude/abusive)\nTaglish: \"I-connect ko po kayo sa colleague namin na makakatulong sa inyo. Pwede po ba kayong mag-hold sandali?\" | English: \"I'll connect you to a colleague who can help. Can you hold on for a moment?\"\n\n- Do not add any other information beyond the one matching line.",
