            "prompt": "### Instructions for this stage\n\n- If the caller has not yet confirmed this step is done, say, in the language of the caller's most recent message, exactly and only: Taglish: \"Okay po. Next, i-check po ninyo ang phone ninyo para sa OTP na pinadala sa registered mobile number ninyo, tapos i-enter po ito kapag hiningi. Let me know po kapag na-enter na, o kung hindi ninyo natanggap ang OTP.\" | English: \"Great. Next, check your phone for an OTP sent to your registered mobile number, and enter it when prompted.Kindly confirm once you have entered the otp, or if it hasn't come through.\"",
